{"t": 1792818656610, "cmd": "note", "args": ["--shot", "nonation", "Village captured 20 game seconds into the stage: tick 1000 'Greenshire has captured your village! Upperwood has fallen' - while the HUD at tick 68 promised 'Sieges can begin in 4:58' and the siege was already 2/6. Siege went 2/6 -> 4/6 (tick 500) -> captured (tick 1000) during the time it takes to open the Nations screen and walk a few metres; declaring war broke the 60 s truce, but the player had no realistic chance to act. Now 'Collapsing! 4:27 left', Nation: none. Expected the 'Sieges can begin in' countdown to be honoured or not shown."]}
