{"t": 1792818850985, "cmd": "note", "args": ["Command bar: the fixed rows (Enter Settlement / Teleport Home / Plant Sapling, and Leave Nation) never moved as pawns came and went - good. But the pawn buttons do move: 'Talk to X (Stranger) - traits' goes at the end of row 2 when the text is short (Mia Brown/Gregarious, Dave Davies/Loyal, Greedy) and jumps to the start of row 1 when it is long (Karl Smith/Loyal, Industrious; Irene Wilson/Greedy, Ambitious), and Gift/Invite slide from x=10 to x=386 accordingly. With the pointer at (470,476) Talk appeared and vanished under it as pawns walked by. See shots/cmdbar_jump.png and shots/cd_strip.png (ticks 3800-6544)."]}
